          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Frosta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Castaspella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentions of - Character</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Double Trouble (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>George (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lance (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mara</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Madame Razz</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also starring several original characters created by yours truly</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>one shot series</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Developing Relationship</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Dating</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Modern AU</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mental Health Issues</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>creative writer adora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>tattoo artist catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>illustrator catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>horse girl adora and crazy cat lady catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>pathetic millenial au</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst and Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>expansion of the universe</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i don't know about you but i am having a blast</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora publishes a book while catra goes back to school</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>bow's family antics</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>how many tv references can i make? lets find out</rdf:li>
